    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk water, lime juice, fish sauce, brown sugar, garlic, ginger, and Sriracha together in a bowl until sugar is dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-byGg-z_1XtblrSjwbUpHxyNtLI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238234-saigon-noodle-salad-VAT-010-step-02-a42aac7a7bdd4bdf98d09b328e053944.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238234/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of water to a full boil; remove from heat. Add rice noodles; soak for 1 minute. Stir to separate noodles; continue soaking until noodles are tender, about 3 minutes more. Drain noodles. Rinse with cold water until cool; shake and drain in a colander to remove as much water as possible.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xOuk-hOdanYqDZjaZMC_HkyLarA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238234-saigon-noodle-salad-VAT-011-step-03-eaf3d203ce9f4188b449e86a8245d1c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238234/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine noodles, cabbage, carrots, shrimp, bean sprouts, cucumber slices, green onions, mint, cilantro, and basil in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E4xAtZu1I4l4YwlvtqHMchIPeUM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238234-saigon-noodle-salad-VAT-012-step-04-232d53a1447e40d6ac64813c0ba8d14b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238234/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle dressing over salad; toss to coat. Top with chopped peanuts.",
